<CaseLayout
  title="FunNow Venue Page Redesign"
  kicker="01 · B2C · App & Web"
  tone="rust"
  description="Before booking, users kept leaving to look up venues on Google. I redesigned the venue page into the place where people choose a venue, with one layout shared by eight business categories."
  lead="Before booking, users kept leaving FunNow to look up venues on Google. I redesigned the venue page into the place where people choose a venue, with one layout shared by eight business categories, so users can make up their minds without leaving the page."
  meta={[
    { label: 'Timeline', value: 'Mar 2026 – Aug 2026' },
